    <briefdescription>
<para>Test suite for LLM-assisted process mining behavior. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These tests evaluate the LLM integration for process mining tasks including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Process conformance analysis</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Compliance verification (5R Rule, Vier-Augen-Prinzip, etc.)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Fraud detection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Activity prediction</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optimization recommendations</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Tests are organized by domain with specific benchmark requirements. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
